The fresh positive claim closes with `#Top`. My first multi-case LLVM comparison attempted `krun --pattern` against a definition compiled without search support; LLVM rejected the diagnostic option before executing any case. I’m preserving that failed log and rebuilding the concrete definition with the required search capability so the rerun tests semantics rather than tooling flags.
